# The Mali-V video codec's firmware images (D164): one .fwb per codec and
# direction, run by the codec's own processor. CIX's, from its
# cix_opensource__vpu_driver (firmware-binaries/), read from FreeBSD's
# /boot/firmware on the Orange Pi 6 Plus. The repository states no
# licence for them. They run only on CIX's hardware, and the owner
# accepted redistributing them on a VectraOS board image (2026-11-20).
package mali-v
arch arm64
licence CIX-fwb-owner-accepted
source CIX's cix_opensource__vpu_driver at 5b9b07b, firmware-binaries/; read from FreeBSD's /boot/firmware on the Orange Pi 6 Plus
